                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "REeYN",
                      "name": "Section heading / About this notice",
                      "fill": "$home-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Acerca de este aviso",
                      "lineHeight": 1.25,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 26,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": -0.5
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "oTcYe",
                      "name": "About this notice / paragraph 1",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Este aviso se refiere al servicio alojado de AIHarder que conecta tu cuenta de AimHarder con apps de IA. AIHarder es un proyecto independiente y no está afiliado a AimHarder.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "PCB6O",
                      "name": "About this notice / paragraph 2",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "AimHarder y las apps de IA que utilizas tienen sus propias políticas de privacidad. Esas políticas se aplican a la información que gestionan en sus servicios.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "q0zyd",
                  "name": "Privacy section / Information we use",
                  "context": "Anchor #information",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "S0VKhn",
                      "name": "Section heading / Information we use",
                      "fill": "$home-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Qué información utilizamos",
                      "lineHeight": 1.25,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 26,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": -0.5
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "x605J5",
                      "name": "Information we use / paragraph 1",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Tu cuenta de AIHarder utiliza tu correo electrónico y tus datos de acceso para identificarte y proteger el acceso. Si eliges entrar con Google, se utiliza la información de Google necesaria para identificar esa cuenta.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kFX7H",
                      "name": "Information we use / paragraph 2",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Conectar AimHarder requiere tus credenciales de AimHarder y la configuración de la conexión, incluido el gimnasio seleccionado. El servicio consulta las clases, entrenos, reservas y registros de actividad necesarios para responder a las solicitudes realizadas a través de tu conexión.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "bSh6I",
                  "name": "Privacy section / Your AimHarder credentials",
                  "context": "Anchor #credentials",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "pg3j6",
                      "name": "Section heading / Your AimHarder credentials",
                      "fill": "$home-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Tus credenciales de AimHarder",
                      "lineHeight": 1.25,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 26,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": -0.5
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "VcEyl",
                      "name": "Your AimHarder credentials / paragraph 1",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "El acceso a AIHarder y la conexión con AimHarder son independientes. El servicio guarda tus credenciales de AimHarder cifradas y puede descifrarlas cuando necesita autenticarse en AimHarder. Es un cifrado recuperable, no de extremo a extremo.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kUTHs",
                      "name": "Your AimHarder credentials / paragraph 2",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Tu contraseña de AimHarder no se incluye en la información que recibe tu app de IA. Introdúcela únicamente en el formulario de conexión de la cuenta, no en un mensaje del chat.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "y3E41",
                  "name": "Privacy section / What your AI app receives",
                  "context": "Anchor #ai-apps",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "t8ZyLM",
                      "name": "Section heading / What your AI app receives",
                      "fill": "$home-ink",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Qué recibe tu app de IA",
                      "lineHeight": 1.25,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 26,
                      "fontWeight": "600",
                      "letterSpacing": -0.5
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "it7E4",
                      "name": "What your AI app receives / paragraph 1",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Una app de IA que hayas autorizado puede enviar solicitudes a través de tu conexión y recibir la información resultante. Según lo que preguntes, puede incluir tus reservas, entrenos o actividad registrada.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ho7nA",
                      "name": "What your AI app receives / paragraph 2",
                      "fill": "$home-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "La app de IA gestiona tu conversación conforme a sus propias condiciones y política de privacidad. Revocar su acceso a AIHarder detiene esa conexión; no elimina la información que ya haya recibido.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "Geist",
                      "fontSize": 17,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
